<title>USA: Data Research to buy back $4 mln in shares.</title>
<headline>Data Research to buy back $4 mln in shares.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Research Associates Inc said Thursday it would buy back up to $4 million of its shares.</p>
<p>The purchases will be made during the next 12 months in the open market and through privately negotiated transactions, the company said. The buyback will be financed out of existing cash, cash equivalents and short-term investments. As of the June 30 conclusion of the company's third fiscal quarter, these totaled $17.1 million, and the company had no long-term debt.</p>
<p>	  -- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
